      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you're feeling this way after dedicating so much of your life to others. That sense of purpose can vanish, leaving a hollow space where meaning used to be. Perhaps it's time to find a way to bring that feeling of \"mission\" back, even if it's something small and personal for yourself. What is one tiny thing you've always wanted to try, just for you?",
